7,A Research project on Folk Dances and Music of Tribes of Mewar,https://www.academia.edu/129199789/A_Research_project_on_Folk_Dances_and_Music_of_Tribes_of_Mewar,"The objective is to delve into all the possible resources to get a more detailed, concise and apt information regarding the music and dance culture of Mewari tribes. However, the paper specifically focuses more on the Bhil tribe that inhabit a major chunk of the tribal population of Mewar region.",Mewari,Indo-European
